The total circumference of the four circles is  

\[
C_{\text{total}} = 2\pi(5 + 10 + 15 + 20)\;\text{cm}
                 = 2\pi(50)\;\text{cm}
                 = 100\pi\;\text{cm}
                 \approx 314.16\;\text{cm}.
\]

So the combined circumference is **100 π cm** (about **314.16 cm**).
